  "prefLabel": "We 207.03 Notice",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "We 207.03 Notice. Notice of the date, time, and place of the hearing shall be given as follows:\n\n(a) For a rulemaking hearing held pursuant to RSA 541-A:\n\n(1) By publication in the rulemaking register pursuant to RSA 541-A; and\n\n(2) By U.S. Mail, agency bulletin or newsletter, or public notice advertisement in a publication of daily statewide circulation.\n\n(b) For all other public hearings, by such means as the board determines will provide notice to those persons likely to be interested in the most cost-effective manner.\n\nSource. #7307, eff 6-13-00; ss by #9178-A, eff 6-13-08",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/we100-1000.html"
}
